#. module: coop_memberspace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:coop_memberspace.shift_registration_cancel_email
msgid ""
"<p>Dear ${object.name},</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>You were registered has a participant to the shift ${object.shift_id.display_name} and you asked to cancel this participation.</p>\n"
"<p>This is a confirmation that the cancellation was taken into account and you are no longer registered to that shift.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Kind regards,\n"
"<br/>\n"
"The member management team\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Cher ${object.name},</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Vous étiez inscrit comme participant au créneau ${object.shift_id.display_name} et vous avez demandé à annuler cette participation.</p>\n"
"<p>Ceci est une confirmation que l'annulation a été prise en compte et que vous n'êtes plus inscrit à ce créneau.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Cordialement,\n"
"<br/>\n"
"L'équipe de gestion des membres\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"

